# Excel files - be selective about which to ignore
# Generated/consolidated Excel files should be ignored, raw data kept
**/results/*.xlsx
**/*consolidated*.xlsx
**/*compiled*.xlsx
**/LDH_consolidated_results.xlsx
**/traintest_compiled.xlsx

# YAML files - generally keep these as they're configuration
